<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">FILIMON</book>
  <para style="h">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filimon</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Chirethleng Mbulus Filimon ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗaɓa ya a har Mbulus chang nanda hu porsǝna ɗǝ ka thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, tǝ ƙǝm a har wan manǝm ɗǝ Timoti tǝ Filimon pashid tar nǝm nggǝm nǝm. <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />Tǝ ƙǝm wan manǝm Afiya tǝ Arkibus pashid tar sodjad nǝm, tǝ fatakkwaya Yeeso na wumnda hai a minda kyawa. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ngwa tsauka nggayid Faara na Chinɗi tǝ tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ yi Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tsauka tǝ kun.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hwan Faara a Filimon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ƙǝtsar a naɗi a hwanda ni usa Faara ka sa, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ƙǝsǝr sǝkɗi fǝrƙǝkafekkid wa ahu Chinǝm Yeeso tǝ ƙǝm nggǝmnda nana tǝghǝn a nafiya Faara. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Niyi a hwan Faara tǝ ndaarha tsawud ɗǝɗemnggid nǝm tǝ ndan fa takkwaya nǝn a kyaɗo sǝnda ǝnggini nanǝm tǝghǝn hu Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Sa wanmana, nggǝm nduwa fǝree ɗǝ wutsǝfayirha kaan tǝ kaali, ƙǝsǝr hur nafiya Faara wal nda kaali a fad wa.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalang Mbulus Filimon sǝ aten Onisimus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Tsaunǝn kee, ahu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ni mbang ndorha a ǝna ˈya na kamngga. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Amma ƙǝsǝr ka nggǝmni sa na minna sǝ hwan sa ni nggi Mbulus, nggi suhurgha nanǝnya, nggi ƙǝm na ahu porsǝna ƙǝsǝr ka Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Niya hwan sa a meghed waana Onisimus ahu Ƙǝrǝsti, tsauɗi ƙǝla Chin, nani ahu porsǝna. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Kaar ɗowasǝ wa, amma nanǝnya ƙǝkafek nǝghǝn a ɗang ƙǝmsǝ kyab. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Niyi a wuɗang thlǝmad wa ɗǝ, ndǝghǝnggi mbǝnegha hur kaan. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Na minnasǝ a tsauka a thlǝmanna a mbǝɗiyahu porsǝna tǝnǝn ɗeesǝ ahu tar Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Amma mbǝ minnasǝ a ǝna ˈya ni kula sǝnduwa wa, ama nǝn naarha nggayid wa a fadna ɓa tsaurha tǝta ni. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Asǝmha ǝnɗi ǝnagha ndǝn mal Onasimu sa yi ɓeena ngguchit tǝna nggǝr thlǝghǝn fa tsauka tǝ sa pakwanɗǝ. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ɓalwa ƙǝla mafarha a sa wa. Kalɗǝ mafarha, ƙǝsǝr ka wanmana ni nggǝm nǝm. Nanǝnya nǝn a ɗorha sǝ kaan, ahu tsawudghǝn niifa tǝ shadnǝm hu Chinǝm. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Nanǝn kee ana pashid tarwa ni nggi, thluwun fa ƙǝla na thlǝ nggi fa. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />A ǝno Onisimus ˈya fa mbuwa ngga nduwa thlǝɗǝ kumarha a harwa nggini a teuƙǝn. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />NGGI MBULUS NIYA CHIRETHLEU ƏNƊA HAI YA TƏ HARNA TƏ NDAARHA NGGINI A TEUƘƏN. MBƏ SEE ƊALONI NDƏN IN FƏREE NA YIƁƏD WA. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Nanǝn kee wanmana hwan ni sa ǝne ˈya tal kee ka thlǝm Chinǝm. Tǝrang hurna sǝ hu Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Mbǝrsaɗi ndǝn chirethleu ni ɗeleewar ɗaɗǝ ya, sǝnɗisǝ na ǝna ǝnɗi hwan ni sa kamanggǝn ko kal yanɗa nǝn mu ya. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Takh ˈya tal fadɗǝn, takse ƙǝnna sǝ ɗǝni tsaurha sǝ, ƙǝsǝr fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek na Faara a sǝk hwandǝ nun na a wuɗeeghǝn thlǝman nun ɗǝ ɗǝɗem.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mii ngwala ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Na Abafaras a ndang ˈya kun fa nan ahu porsǝna kyab ka thlǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Tǝ ƙǝm ɗa na nda Markus tǝ Aristakus tǝ Ndimas tǝ Luka nan a ǝna taara. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ngwa tsaukwa nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tsauka tǝ sǝsǝn nun. Atsaukake.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>